                <p class="mb-2"><b>BMI Formula:</b> <code>BMI = Weight(Kgs) / (Height(In) * Height(In))</code> (BMI must be in 2 decimal places, hint: <code>Math.Floor</code>)</p>

                <div class="qa-table">
                    <table class="table table-sm table-bordered align-middle">
                        <thead><tr><th>Goal</th><th>BMI Condition</th><th>Fee</th></tr></thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr><td>Weight Loss</td><td>BMI &gt;= 25 &amp;&amp; BMI &lt; 30</td><td>2000</td></tr>
                            <tr><td>Weight Loss</td><td>BMI &gt;= 30 &amp;&amp; BMI &lt; 35</td><td>2500</td></tr>
                            <tr><td>Weight Loss</td><td>BMI &gt;= 35</td><td>3000</td></tr>
                            <tr><td>Weight Gain</td><td>Any</td><td>2500</td></tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
